hing is  saved when detective Chesser arrives on  the scene and makes quick work of the  crazy lawyer the only question that  remains where are the diamonds with the  diamond  well we do learn Adams final words are  in the garden yet Katie four months  later hasn't bothered to follow up on  the friggin last words of her husband  maybe this is also the first time in  four months she's turned on her  sprinkler but it reveals that the  Diamonds were buried about less than an  inch in the garden because if you're  gonna bury three million worth of  diamonds you just put him right on top  where an easy downpour of rain could  wash him away also she's pregnant  because why not to be honest it's a  pretty sad ending this kid's gonna grow  up without a father Adam the guy who was  going to school so he could get a better  job and support his family dies and our  main character doesn't really change  throughout the film the Katie we see at  the beginning is the same Katie we see  at the end but she's pregnant and I  guess even though we found out the will  was forged she gets to keep it which is  kind of cool that's it for dangerous  lies just thought I'd throw a quick  video out today but I want to hear your  thoughts in the comments below make sure  to LIKE and subscribe and if you haven't  seen it check out my video on secret  obsession for more bad takes you can  also follow me on twitter at things  story whitey until next time remember  daddy loves you very much
 

